# Build context for the famledger image. The image needs `server/src`,
# `server/package.json` and the built web bundle at `app/build/web` — nothing
# else, and definitely not anyone's real ledger.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# planning + spec artefacts
.superpowers

# node
node_modules
**/node_modules
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# a live database must never be baked into an image
data
server/data

# flutter: keep only the compiled web bundle
app/.dart_tool
app/.flutter-plugins
app/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
app/.packages
# `app/build/*` 而不是 `app/build`：后者是「排除父目录再把子目录捞回来」，
# 那是 Docker ignore 语义里出了名的脆弱写法，不同 BuildKit 版本行为不保证一致 ——
# 而这两行是编译好的 Web 看板进镜像的**唯一**通路，它一失效镜像里就只剩一个
# .gitkeep，首页变成「还没构建前端」的说明页。排除到子项一级（`app/build/*` 的
# `*` 不跨 `/`，只吃 app/build 的直接子项），再把 web 这一项捞回来，就不依赖那条
# 例外规则了。app/build/app 有 2.6 GB（Android 中间产物），漏出去就是灾难。
app/build/*
!app/build/web
!app/build/web/**
app/android/.gradle
app/android/local.properties
app/android/key.properties
app/ios/Pods
app/ios/.symlinks
app/ios/Flutter/ephemeral
app/.idea
app/*.iml

# editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
